<title>USA: TABLE - Comerica Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Comerica Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.16		    $1.00</p>
<p> Net			129,710		  118,221</p>
<p> Net int. income	363,528		  356,489</p>
<p> Nonint. income	 121,447		  120,790</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	  34,000		   25,000</p>
<p> Total assets	36,000,000	     35,000,000</p>
<p> Return on equity	 21.31		    17.73</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     107,933		  118,098</p>
<p>	  6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.26		    $1.98</p>
<p> Net			253,482		  234,827</p>
<p> Net int. income	715,313		  705,750</p>
<p> Nonint. income	 250,841		  258,218</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	  75,000		   53,500</p>
<p> Total assets	36,000,000	     35,000,000</p>
<p> Return on equity	 20.86		    17.50</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     108,506		  118,620</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers. Return in equity is in percent.)</p>
<p>NOTES - Q2 net interest income includes loan loss provisions of $34 million and $25 million in '97 and '96, respectively; and $75 million and $53 million in 6 month periods of '97 and'96, respectively.</p>
</text>
